# Podcast Knowledge Ingest — weekly Monday 06:17 UTC
# Managed by supervisord via supercronic. Edit this file to change schedule.
# Channel list: podcasts.yaml (same directory, or --config path)

# supercronic runs jobs via /bin/sh with only the supervisor PATH. All three
# jobs need more than that: coreutils for `tee`, node for submit-proposals.mjs,
# the python env for `yt-dlp` (which podcast-ingest still shells out to), and
# the podcast-ingest/podcast-promote binaries themselves.
#
# There is deliberately NO `PATH=` line here any more. It used to pin Nix store
# paths by hand — which went stale on every image rebuild, and silently
# overrode whatever the supervisor exported. The PATH is now built by Nix in
# flake.nix's [program:podcast-cron] environment= and inherited by these jobs,
# so store paths can never drift out of sync with the image again.

